WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
In 1835 the Sun published a six-part story about lunar life.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
The invented discoveries borrowed a real astronomer’s authority.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
A reprint repeats an assertion; it is not a new observation.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
The paper is historical evidence. Its Moon creatures are not verified discoveries.
